.\n — α〉 eines Daitya.\n — β〉 eines Sohnes des 7ten Manu.\n— 3〉 f. रिष्टा N. pr. der Mutter der Apsaras. Richtig wohl अरिष्टा.\n— 4〉 n.\n — a〉 Unheil, Unglück UTPALA zu VARĀH. BṚH. 6,12.\n — b〉 ein ungünstiges Vorzeichen.\n — c〉 *Glück, Heil.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["रिष्टं", "रिष्टः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["rizwaM", "rizwaH"]}], "riswaka": [{"id": "rizwaka", "headword": "रिष्टक", "headword_slp1": "rizwaka", "fold": "riswaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*रिष्टक m. Sapindus detergens.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["रिष्टकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["rizwakaH"]}], "riswatati": [{"id": "rizwatAti", "headword": "रिष्टताति", "headword_slp1": "rizwatAti", "fold": "riswatati", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*रिष्टताति Adj. = क्षेमंकर.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "riswi": [{"id": "rizwi", "headword": "रिष्टि", "headword_slp1": "rizwi", "fold": "riswi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "1. रि꣫ष्टि f. Schaden; das Misslingen, Fehlschlagen.", "gloss_language": "de"}, {"gloss": "2. रिष्टि m. = ऋष्टि Schwert. Diese Bed. soll das Wort in अरिष्ट्यामय (Nachtr. 5) nach dem Comm. haben.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["रिष्टिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["rizwiH"]}], "riswiy": [{"id": "rizwIy", "headword": "रिष्टीय्", "headword_slp1": "rizwIy", "fold": "riswiy", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*!√रिष्टीय्, रिष्टीयति = !√रिषण्य्.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "risPa": [{"id": "rizPa", "headword": "रिष्फ", "headword_slp1": "rizPa", "fold": "risPa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "रिष्फ n. = रिःफ.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "risyamuka": [{"id": "rizyamUka", "headw